# CLOUD6 does not use a root-level .env — each app loads its own.
#
# Server config (loaded from apps/server/.env, cwd = apps/server when
# run via `npm run dev`): see apps/server/.env.example
#
# Mobile config (Expo only exposes EXPO_PUBLIC_ vars to the client):
# see apps/mobile/.env.example
#
# Setup:
#   cp apps/server/.env.example apps/server/.env
#   cp apps/mobile/.env.example apps/mobile/.env
#
# Neither file currently requires a real secret or API key — Open-Meteo
# and OSRM's demo routing server are free, keyless public APIs, and this
# codebase has no authentication/database layer yet.
